// Barbie Dreamhouse
// LIGHT theme inspired by the 2023 Barbie movie aesthetic
// Hot pink (#FF1493) + white + gold accents on pink-tinted ivory base
// Token inversion: White=#dark, Black=#light for proper light theme behavior
// Author: Claude

